<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1344440225"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1881370933"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Floating (feat. Khalid) [filous Remix]"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Alina Baraz / filous / Khalid"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Floating (filous Remix)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:20.865"><div begin="00:01.395" end="03:11.764"><p begin="00:01.395" end="00:03.673" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">It's in the way you see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的眼神告诉我</span></p><p begin="00:03.973" end="00:06.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">You know what I need<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我需要什么</span></p><p begin="00:06.623" end="00:09.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">It's in the way that you're holding me, bringing me close<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你抱着我 让我一点点靠近 这感觉让我沉迷</span></p><p begin="00:10.070" end="00:12.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">You know that I won't let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道的 我不会放手</span></p><p begin="00:12.014" end="00:14.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">You've got me on repeat (Repeat)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我一遍遍为你动心</span></p><p begin="00:14.517" end="00:17.224" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">You've got me in a dream (A dream)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我仿佛置身梦境</span></p><p begin="00:17.224" end="00:20.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I let my worries go soon as you come through the door<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看到你那一刻 我的忧虑烦恼全都消失不见</span></p><p begin="00:20.346" end="00:23.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Thinking 'bout what it'd be like to be yours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想想如果我属于你 那会是什么感觉</span></p><p begin="00:23.907" end="00:26.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">2am, and I'm still breathing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凌晨两点 我依旧毫无睡意</span></p><p begin="00:29.172" end="00:32.893" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Staring at my thoughts floating up to the ceiling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着思绪在天花板飘荡</span></p><p begin="00:32.892" end="00:35.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I'm swimming in everything you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在细细考虑你的每一句话</span></p><p begin="00:35.522" end="00:38.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I'm thinking 'bout jumping in instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已深陷爱的漩涡</span></p><p begin="00:38.169" end="00:42.633" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I've got you skinny dipping deep inside my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你的身影永远留在我的脑海</span></p><p begin="00:43.458" end="00:46.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I'm swimming in everything you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在细细考虑你的每一句话</span></p><p begin="00:46.139" end="00:48.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm thinking 'bout jumping in instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已深陷爱的漩涡</span></p><p begin="00:48.786" end="00:53.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I've got you skinny dipping deep inside my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你的身影永远留在我的脑海</span></p><p begin="01:05.005" end="01:07.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">It's in the way you touch me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的温柔触碰让我难以忘怀</span></p><p begin="01:07.656" end="01:10.124" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I don't know much about love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对爱一窍不通</span></p><p begin="01:10.134" end="01:13.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">But I'll keep on checking my phone to see when you're home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我会不停查看手机 看你什么时候回家</span></p><p begin="01:13.541" end="01:15.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Or when you want me to pull up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是想让我接你回家</span></p><p begin="01:16.202" end="01:18.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">We're one in the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是同一类人</span></p><p begin="01:18.277" end="01:20.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">You got me caught in a daze<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我神魂颠倒</span></p><p begin="01:20.773" end="01:24.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">I love it when you say my name real slow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢你轻轻地念我的名字</span></p><p begin="01:24.225" end="01:27.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">All my love is yours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所有的爱都是属于你的</span></p><p begin="01:25.933" end="01:28.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I'm swimming in everything you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在细细考虑你的每一句话</span></p><p begin="01:28.574" end="01:31.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I'm thinking 'bout jumping in instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已深陷爱的漩涡</span></p><p begin="01:31.215" end="01:35.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I've got you skinny dipping deep inside my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你的身影永远留在我的脑海</span></p><p begin="01:36.485" end="01:39.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I'm swimming in everything you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在细细考虑你的每一句话</span></p><p begin="01:39.162" end="01:41.833" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I'm thinking 'bout jumping in instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已深陷爱的漩涡</span></p><p begin="01:41.843" end="01:48.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I've got you skinny dipping deep inside my head (Inside my head)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你的身影永远留在我的脑海</span></p><p begin="01:58.748" end="02:02.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Every time you move<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着你的一举一动</span></p><p begin="02:03.049" end="02:05.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">You're looking like you're dancing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的身姿就像跳舞般优美</span></p><p begin="02:05.861" end="02:09.397" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I think that you could have it (Oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想你跳舞的景象一定很美</span></p><p begin="02:09.492" end="02:12.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Everything you do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一件事</span></p><p begin="02:13.763" end="02:15.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I want to do it with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都想和你一起去做</span></p><p begin="02:16.433" end="02:18.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Don't ever want to miss you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想永远把你记在心里</span></p><p begin="02:20.664" end="02:25.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">2am, and I'm still breathing (You do, you do, you do)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凌晨两点 我依旧毫无睡意</span></p><p begin="02:25.912" end="02:29.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Staring at my thoughts floating up to the ceiling (You do, you do, you do, you do)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着思绪在天花板飘荡</span></p><p begin="02:29.557" end="02:32.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I'm swimming in everything you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在细细考虑你的每一句话</span></p><p begin="02:32.216" end="02:34.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">I'm thinking 'bout jumping in instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已深陷爱的漩涡</span></p><p begin="02:34.857" end="02:40.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I've got you skinny dipping deep inside my head (Inside my head)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你的身影永远留在我的脑海</span></p><p begin="02:40.174" end="02:42.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">I'm swimming in everything you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在细细考虑你的每一句话</span></p><p begin="02:42.827" end="02:45.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I'm thinking 'bout jumping in instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我已深陷爱的漩涡</span></p><p begin="02:45.463" end="02:51.633" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">I've got you skinny dipping deep inside my head (Inside my head)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你的身影永远留在我的脑海</span></p><p begin="02:55.744" end="02:58.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">With you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你永远在一起</span></p><p begin="03:03.535" end="03:06.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">You do, you do, you do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你愿意吗</span></p><p begin="03:07.483" end="03:11.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">You do, you do, you do, you do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你愿意吗</span></p></div></body></tt>